:0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3625287953","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113676#issuecomment-3625287953","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113676","id":3625287953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YFYER","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T06:52:51Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T06:53:45Z","body":"Looks like this is only an issue with our prefiltered importance sampling code. If you change the Sky update mode to \"Realtime\" the issue goes away. \n\nAlternatively, you can increase the value of [`rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/ggx_samples`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-rendering-reflections-sky-reflections-ggx-samples) until the issue goes away. For me 128 samples looks perfect. \n\nI didn't see this artifact through most of my testing, but I did have to do a nasty rebase right before committing, so I suspect that this issue snuck in during the rebase and I didn't notice it. I'll look into a fix ASAP\n\nThat perfect circle right at (0.5, 0,5) is so suspicious, there is probably a very silly error","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3625287953/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3625365400","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113676#issuecomment-3625365400","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113676","id":3625365400,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YFq-Y","user":{"login":"KawaiiPrincess","id":17956347,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTU2MzQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17956347?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess","html_url":"https://github.com/KawaiiPrincess","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KawaiiPrincess/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T07:22:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T07:23:31Z","body":"Setting the update mode to realtime also has a large difference for me between dev 5 and dev 6 (direct sunlight disabled, ambient light only):\n<img width=\"178\" height=\"265\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/036a8f66-4bbc-4f80-9916-172ea0297e56\" /><img width=\"178\" height=\"265\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3140adda-cfdb-433d-933a-4a624ae2ced3\" />\nNo project settings seem to improve the appearance of ambient light when using realtime mode.\n\nSetting the samples to 128 makes it look like it did before, but I'm noticing that switching between dev 5 and dev 6, with 128 samples and update mode set to high quality incremental, that the new implementation also performs worse than the old one.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3625365400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626485268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113676#issuecomment-3626485268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113676","id":3626485268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YJ8YU","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use